        <mxCell id="7" value="W17: &quot;Build a tiny game&quot;, owner S10, published, capacity 3. Stored reservations: S21 and S22. Ari = S23 / ari@example.invalid; no seat yet.&#10;Ari already has a valid signed session created after Campus Identity verification. Storage works; nobody else acts during this trace.&#10;Internal calls are Python in-process calls. External browser/mail calls use HTTPS; database calls use PostgreSQL protocol / TLS." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#152b46;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
